       "cyr": "Едно време си бев ерген,",
       "lat": "Edno vreme si bev ergen,",
       "en": "One time I was a bachelor,"
      },
      {
       "cyr": "ем работа си немав.",
       "lat": "em rabota si nemav.",
       "en": "even a job I didn't have."
      },
      {
